<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-25T19:49:24.318Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:49:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Taliban forces are confronting Pakistani security troops along the Kurram border while Pakistan has halted trade at two Iran crossings, affecting the Zangali checkpost and Torkham operations. The United Nations warns that Afghanistan is one step away from famine and the Taliban has opened a road to China that faces security hurdles. Iran remains open to US talks under a Pakistan-brokered deal and a new opium-related hub is emerging in Afghan borderlands with Iran and Pakistan after the Taliban ban. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168631&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPaEdOMTREYVE2LV9VUVg4bl95OHhyZ1VFamwyeUVoLWY2RTNCLUkwNTZGYUdJbVZXVW5GR18wS21pNWFIUldHUmJCRHZ6THI2NnI4Zi1ITmFsdmtoSU9raFY4ZjI0bk9FTHhtRkhVd0VQenJINDZsSU16S3dPX1hpMkZaR3E4UHhTcTNBamdOQ1FQX1lETG5za3YzeXU0aGVlaGFhNlNLdTJEVDZja1JWRUc2eXhqS3FGZWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1yemxsY3k5dXN2ZzE5NGFheUlvenBIRHFVVlYxdndVcnlRNU5KMm9IMmticGluZmhtTTdDVm8xTWFQSmdPNDhuXw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1UbDZSUXV2d2ZJVnVZNzA3Z3pWb2x3UEVGQ3lvV2VpakcxVFR1VGw2UUNCeEJOajF4WjJJbi00VnE3Tkp6ZEE4Uw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNTUpXRUkwMldIUlpBTTRDSWJtWnI2RWM5cW96WEpWSFZGRV85bmJaNjJvak5NUlE0TFVJWi1YMy1VUXdiaFFiUUhIc19SZm53Y3A3bWRjbFhsR05BZTJZY1ZWTGtQVXRERnc3allzdmxST2VkVjFxcG9wNU5FNkVnX3A3REtwSW1kdEx2RmdYa2d0aEZLNjBnTGtpekhOMF9VcTFlZW16TTI4bUU5anhOSTU5LU5rVTJ2Y182OVJvZmhQSmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<